    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Photo-Life - Rina's Journey!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Rina in her travels and assist her as photographer during a complete year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Listen to her and help her chose between two careers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Edit the shoots and send them to the agency for validation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/fd1262b9bf34c10dbfa95028b6f1d8a7.avif?t=1728315958\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is split in 11 acts leading to 2 different ends:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Sundress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Beach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Casual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Home Sweet Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Mariage dress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Cosplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Nightdress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>and more!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Play an original <strong>photo editing</strong> minigame procedurally generated in 3 difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Exactly 65 pictures of Rina to unlock in Story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>10+ Extra pictures to unlock including pictures from friend artists like Harstfazn, Mistimagi, PaulGQ, Riju, Taiyu or Kirizaki ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Earn $$$ to use bonuses or to skip some activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Gallery with slideshow feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" /></div>Download your favorite pictures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally generated levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you will start a level, a set of parameters will be applied to the pictures and used as elements to correct. The number of parameters and the precision requested will depend the difficulty (easy, medium, hard). If you replay a level, the parameters will be different. The game currently includes 20 different parameters to tweak the pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All arts by Erkaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/0e100e3f9909d5d1a8e017d60189054d.avif?t=1728315958\" /></div></p>",
